<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Hello, <o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal">We have received the bank statements for the reconciliation
